      "content": "I'll read the original test and the CUT source to understand the code before improving understandability.Now I have a clear picture. I'll write the improved test: remove the ~12 unused data methods, trim unused imports, and reformat `data_plus` to be readable with one row per line and group comments.The improved test compiled successfully. The refactored version removes 12 unused data-provider methods and ~40 unused imports, then reformats `data_plus` with one test case per line and inline comments grouping the seven temporal units (DAYS, WEEKS, MONTHS, YEARS, DECADES, CENTURIES, MILLENNIA), making the intent of each scenario immediately clear."
